### ==================================================
### User Management API Tests
### Module: User Management (Prompt 11)
### ==================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@acmeAdminToken = {{loginAcmeAdmin.response.body.token}}
@acmeSalesToken = {{loginAcmeSales.response.body.token}}
@techStartAdminToken = {{loginTechStartAdmin.response.body.token}}

### ==================================================
### SETUP - Authentication
### ==================================================

### Login as Acme Admin
# @name loginAcmeAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "email": "john@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as Acme Sales User
# @name loginAcmeSales
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "email": "sales@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as TechStart Admin
# @name loginTechStartAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "email": "jane@techstart.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================================================
### TEAM MEMBERS - Available to All Authenticated Users
### ==================================================

### Get Team Members (for assignment dropdowns)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/team
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Team Members as Sales User (should work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/team
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### USER LISTING - Admin Only
### ==================================================

### Get All Users (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get All Users with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Search by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=john
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Search by Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=@acme.com
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Filter by Role (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=ADMIN
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Filter by Role (SALES)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=SALES
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Filter by Role (SUPPORT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=SUPPORT
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Filter Active Users Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Filter Inactive Users Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Combined Filters (Active + Role + Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?isActive=true&role=SALES&search=sales
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Sort by First Name (ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?sortBy=firstName&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Sort by Last Login (DESC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?sortBy=lastLoginAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### USER DETAILS - Admin Only
### ==================================================

### Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get User Details with Counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Non-Existent User (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/non-existent-user-id
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### USER UPDATES - Admin Only
### ==================================================

### Update User - First Name Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "firstName": "Michael"
}

### Update User - Last Name Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "lastName": "Smith"
}

### Update User - Multiple Fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "firstName": "Michael",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "phone": "+1-555-0123"
}

### Update User - Change Role to MANAGER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

### Update User - Change Role to SALES
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "role": "SALES"
}

### Update User - Change Role to SUPPORT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "role": "SUPPORT"
}

### Update User - Add Avatar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "avatar": "https://example.com/avatars/user-2.jpg"
}

### Update Own User - Cannot Change Own Role (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "role": "SALES"
}

### ==================================================
### USER ACTIVATION/DEACTIVATION - Admin Only
### ==================================================

### Deactivate User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-3-acme/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Verify User is Deactivated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-3-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Deactivate Already Inactive User (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-3-acme/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Reactivate User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-3-acme/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Verify User is Reactivated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-3-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Reactivate Already Active User (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-3-acme/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Deactivate Self (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### USER STATISTICS - Admin Only
### ==================================================

### Get User Statistics - All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get User Statistics for TechStart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### ==================================================
### USER ACTIVITY - Admin Only
### ==================================================

### Get User Activity Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity for Different User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity for Non-Existent User (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/non-existent-user/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### AUTHORIZATION TESTS - Non-Admin Access
### ==================================================

### Sales User Tries to List Users (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sales User Tries to Get User Details (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sales User Tries to Update User (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "firstName": "Unauthorized"
}

### Sales User Tries to Deactivate User (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sales User Tries to Get Stats (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sales User Tries to Get User Activity (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeSalesToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### TENANT ISOLATION
### ==================================================

### TechStart Admin Tries to Access Acme User (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### TechStart Admin Tries to Update Acme User (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "firstName": "Hacked"
}

### TechStart Admin Tries to Deactivate Acme User (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-1-acme/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Verify TechStart Can Only See Their Own Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Verify TechStart Stats Only Show Their Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### ==================================================
### ERROR HANDLING
### ==================================================

### Get Users - No Authentication (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - No Tenant Header (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}

### Get Users - Invalid Token (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-xyz
X-Tenant: acme

### Update User - Invalid User ID (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/invalid-user-id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "firstName": "Test"
}

### ==================================================
### EDGE CASES
### ==================================================

### Update User - Empty Body (should succeed, no changes)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{}

### Update User - Invalid Role (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "role": "INVALID_ROLE"
}

### Search Users - No Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=nonexistentuser123456
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Users - Page Beyond Total (should return empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=999&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### WORKFLOW SCENARIOS
### ==================================================

### Scenario 1: New Employee Onboarding
# Step 1: List current team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 2: Get team member list for assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/team
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 3: Check statistics before adding
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 2: User Role Change
# Step 1: Get current user details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 2: Check user's current activity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 3: Promote to Manager
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

###
# Step 4: Verify role change
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-2-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 3: Employee Departure
# Step 1: Get user details before deactivation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-4-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 2: Check their workload/assignments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-4-acme/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 3: Deactivate user account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/user-4-acme/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Step 4: Verify deactivation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Scenario 4: Team Analytics
# Get team statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# List recently active users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?sortBy=lastLoginAt&sortOrder=desc&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
# Check distribution by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=SALES
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=SUPPORT
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeAdminToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

